---
title: Confession of Sin (Most merciful God)
type: prayer
citation: BCP 331
rite: I
---

[Deacon] Let us humbly confess our sins unto Almighty God.
[Rubric] *Silence may be kept. Minister and People*
[All] **Most merciful God, we confess that we have sinned against thee in thought, word, and deed, by what we have done, and by what we have left undone. We have not loved thee with our whole heart; we have not loved our neighbors as ourselves.**

---

[All] **We are truly sorry and we humbly repent. For the sake of thy Son Jesus Christ, have mercy on us and forgive us; that we may delight in thy will, and walk in thy ways, to the glory of thy Name. Amen.**
